DESCRIPTION:April is Earth Month! Earth Day has been commemorated on April
  22 for more than 55 years. In 2026\, the Duke community continues to cel
 ebrate with special events\, opportunities and features throughout the mo
 nth\, and we have featured a sample of programming\, with more info added
  regularly.
